# Security

- Default deny. Enforce RBAC plus ABAC for tenant, territory, purpose and classification.
- Require MFA in non-local environments.
- Encrypt in transit and at rest; keep secrets outside code and logs.
- Test cross-tenant isolation automatically.
- Use synthetic or masked fixtures outside production.
- AI retrieval is limited to authorized collections and must cite evidence IDs.
- Prompt input and output pass through DLP and policy checks.
- Tool calls require least privilege and produce immutable audit events.

